. local txt "Notes: Acquisition here = the first year a firm reports foreign owners holding 10% or more of its capital, 
> after an earlier year below 10%."

. local txt "`txt' It is a change in the reported share, not a verified purchase: the chart cannot show who bought the f
> irm or why. Each firm is counted"

. local txt "`txt' once, in that year. Majority = 50% or more foreign in that year. Right bars: of these firms, those ba
> ck below 10% at their next answer"

